    <code>bo:cell-change</code>, formatted with the exported
    <code>currencyDecimals()</code>); the Qty column total is
    <strong>auto-sum</strong> (<code>data-sum-of</code>). Grand total shows
    "mixed" if row currencies differ — a totals decision the framework
